    <string name="tour_1_title">Welcome to Korvy</string>
    <string name="tour_1_body">A private home screen: no accounts, no ads, no analytics, and no server of ours. Online extras like the weather stay off until you turn them on.</string>
    <string name="tour_2_title">All your apps</string>
    <string name="tour_2_body">Swipe up anywhere on the home screen to see every app. Press Home to come back.</string>
    <string name="tour_3_title">Search everything</string>
    <string name="tour_3_body">Tap the search bar and type a few letters: \"gm\" finds Google Maps. Press Go to open the first app, or search the web with DuckDuckGo or another engine you choose in Settings.</string>
    <string name="tour_4_title">Hide and lock apps</string>
    <string name="tour_4_body">Long-press any app and choose Hide, or Hide and lock to protect it with your fingerprint or PIN. Find them again in Settings → Hidden apps.</string>
    <string name="tour_5_title">Apps for right now</string>
    <string name="tour_5_body">The home screen learns which apps you open at different times and days, and suggests them. It\'s all worked out on this phone. Turn it off or forget the history in Settings.</string>
    <string name="tour_6_title">Korvy, your assistant</string>
    <string name="tour_6_body">Optional, and it runs on this phone. Tap ✦ or hold the power button: \"call Jen\", \"set an alarm for 7\", \"when I say goodnight, play rain sounds\". It always asks before texting, calling or booking.</string>
    <string name="tour_7_title">Make Korvy your home screen</string>
    <string name="tour_7_body">Set it as your home app so the Home button opens it. Long-press the home screen any time for Settings.</string>
